	)
	(text "Guard the high-impedance input area on both PCB sides with PH_BUF.\nConnect guard to U1 pins 2 and 7.\nRemove solder mask over the input and guard area.\n\nKeep ground pours, supply traces and digital signals\naway from and beneath the high-impedance input area.\n\nKeep the analog input area away from the ESP32 antenna\nand switching regulator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
